## Paired comparisons (buggy cases only)

**blindspot vs baseline_direct** (n = 9 paired cases)

- discordance: b = 0 system-only, c = 4 baseline-only
- exact two-sided McNemar p = 0.125 (mid-p = 0.0625) — NOT significant at α = 
0.05
- Δ = -44.4 pp, 95% bootstrap [-77.8, -11.1]
- 4 discordant pairs; exact conditional McNemar is the appropriate test at this
n.

**blindspot vs baseline_agent** (n = 9 paired cases)

- discordance: b = 0 system-only, c = 5 baseline-only
- exact two-sided McNemar p = 0.0625 (mid-p = 0.03125) — NOT significant at α =
0.05
- Δ = -55.6 pp, 95% bootstrap [-88.9, -22.2]
- 5 discordant pairs; exact conditional McNemar is the appropriate test at this
n.


